	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia Christi tecum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ipse quoque, mi venerande <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, si quid votis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>proficeretur, unum illud a domino mihi optarem, ut quamprimum et ex corpore <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>hocce morti et sęculo plusquam deploratissimis calamitatibus obnoxio eriperet.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Quorsum enim adtinet diu hic, non dicam vivere, sed quotidie sexcenties mori?</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Non adducar, ut credam iam inde ab initio mortalium res peiore loco <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>fuisse, quemadmodum fidelium pietas maxime nunc omnibus conspicua fuerit; <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>cum illis ut dominus nos adnumeret, omnibus nobis nervis adnitendum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/><persName ref="p18538">Caesar</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> proximis hisce diebus a <placeName ref="l907">Cambodunensibus</placeName> expectatus est;<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Der Kaiser war am 15. Juli in <placeName ref="l907">Kempten</placeName>; vgl. <bibl source="b610">Stälin</bibl> 577.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quo an pervenerit, in horas rescire a nostris cupimus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Experietur ille extrema adversus<pb type="edition" next="168"/> <persName ref="p20225">Gallum</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">König <persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName></note> et <persName ref="p18605">Iuliacensem</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Herzog <persName ref="p18605">Wilhelm von Jülich-Berg-Kleve-Geldern</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>plusquam maxima vi pulveris bombardici et militaribus <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>copiis instructus, pertinaciter interim dissimulans, quę orbi christiano <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ex<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">ex <hi>verbessert aus unlesbarem Wort.</hi></note> <persName ref="p18593">Turco</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Sultan <persName ref="p18593">Suleiman I.</persName></note> imminent pericula, quę prae privatis suis, ut existimat, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>iniuriis fortiter et excelso pectore contemnit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Christus et illius <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>et nostri misereatur!</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Plane video nullum reliquum esse remedio <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>locum, postquam, qui mederi debebant christianis, suopte gladio tanta <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>crudelitate christianos occidunt, magis illorum quam <placeName ref="l2510">Turcorum</placeName> sanguinem <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sitientes.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Wir muͤsend ainmal dem butzen<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">dem vermummten Teufel.</note> in sack; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ist ain lang beschuldte sach; drum schickt es sich darzuͦ.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Quę de praesentibus rerum pressuris ac turbinibus subinde accepero, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>diligenter, ut resciscas, curabo, quamquam non raro tabellarios <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>desidero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Commentarios tuos<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Gemeint ist ein Teil von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Johanneskommentar, s. zuletzt oben <ref target="file11806">Nr. 1760</ref>, 16-19.</note> longe luculentissimos <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>venerabundus excepi persuasum habens nihilo illos minus <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>eruditos ac frugiferos fore quam superiores omnes, quos non <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ego solum, qui nullus sum<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">sum <hi>verbessert aus</hi> suet[?].</note>, sed optimi et doctissimi quique plurimi <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>faciunt.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Gratias agerem pluribus, nisi plus nimio datum a <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>me tibi verborum esset.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Utinam dominus alicunde suppeditet, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quo re ipsa meam tibi gratitudinem, quo nihil magis in votis <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>est, probare possim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p41">Michaelem</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p41">Michael Adam</persName>.</note>, quem plane talem, qualem <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>mihi describebas<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11793">Nr. 1747</ref>, 12-19.</note>, inveni<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">inveni <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note>, vicissim tibi commendo.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Valde amare <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>hic cępimus bonum virum et huc propediem rediturum <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>speramus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Ora pro nobis ardenter.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Commenda nos <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>fratribus, quibus nostris verbis cum tota tua domo <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>multam dic salutem.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te nostri omnes.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>charissime cordis mei frater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l257">Constantiae</placeName>, 10. iulii 1543.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8055">Ambr. Blaurerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Per <persName ref="p41">Michaelem</persName>, symmystam <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>nostrum,<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Gemeint ist wohl <persName ref="p4225">Michael Back</persName>, der von 1540 bis 1548 Pfarrer in <placeName ref="l257">Konstanz</placeName> war; s. <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl> <ref target="file10899">[Nr. 859]</ref>, S. 356f, Anm. 1.</note> licebit, si quid <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>forte voles, rescribere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName> suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
